# phi-agent — A2 (worker) perimeter.
#
# A2 has a shell; the containment IS the boundary. The ONE working directory
# chosen for the session (mounted by phi-agent-contain --workdir at
# /home/agent/work), its own XDG trees, and toolchain caches are writable;
# nothing else exists. Network is removed (--unshare-net) and reintroduced
# as a whitelist; there is no direct route out of this namespace.
#
# Git identity is passed as GIT_AUTHOR_* / GIT_COMMITTER_* environment
# variables, never by mounting ~/.gitconfig (which can carry credential
# helpers and insteadOf URL rewrites).
#
# A2 does NOT publish to or fetch from remotes: it edits and commits locally;
# publishing is the user's action. No SSH key, no SSH-agent socket, and no
# network path to a forge.

# A2's own XDG trees — writable.
rw   @AGENT_DATA@                @CONTAINER_HOME@/.local/share
rw   @AGENT_STATE@               @CONTAINER_HOME@/.local/state
rw   @AGENT_CACHE@               @CONTAINER_HOME@/.cache

# The engine config, read-only. "?" — you create it from
# opencode.example.json (it carries the model id). Absent, opencode cannot
# start but a bare `sh` in the container still can.
ro?  @AGENT_CONFIG@/opencode/opencode.json   @CONTAINER_HOME@/.config/opencode/opencode.json

# The single working directory is bound by phi-agent-contain (--workdir DIR,
# normally from `phi agent code`) at @CONTAINER_HOME@/work — read-write, and
# the only thing under $HOME the session can see. Not listed here because it
# is chosen per session, not a fixed perimeter path.

# Toolchain caches dedicated to A2 — writable, separate from the user's own.
# Path from PHI_AGENT_A2_TOOLCHAIN_CACHE, default under the A2 cache tree.
rw?  @A2_TOOLCHAIN_CACHE@        @CONTAINER_HOME@/.cache/phi-agent-toolchains

# The network bridge dir (~/.local/state/phi-agent/net -> /run/phi-agent/net)
# is bound by phi-agent-contain itself, not listed here: structural to the
# --unshare-net design, not a per-project perimeter choice. It carries the two
# unix sockets (broker-a2.sock, proxy.sock) that are A2's only route out.
